# Quotation module

- Top-level module at `/app/quotation`; Tax Management is a **sub-branch** (sidebar only).
- Transaction types come from Tax Management (`quo_tax_types`), not hardcoded in quotation UI.
- Line totals recomputed server-side via `taxcalc.ComputeLine` on save.
- Status and Outstanding reports: **filter-first** (F8), no auto-load.
- Grids use `erp-grid` class for stretch + wrap.
